# Deployment snapshot (D-027): processed PUBLIC datasets only, so a fresh clone can run the app.
#   NASA POWER (both cells, with the raw API responses for checksum verification), GPM IMERG via POWER
#   (processed only), NOAA CPC gauge counts. NEVER un-ignore data/raw/stations or data/processed/stations
#   (NOAA GSOD, WMO Resolution 40) or IMD files (no redistribution terms found); deploys fetch those at build time.
!data/processed/power_daily_lucknow_19810101_20261113_20261114T173438Z/
!data/processed/power_daily_lucknow_airport_19810101_20261113_20261114T210009Z/
